Could you approve this head with `/ok to test e4859cf6c8fea3a9c555acfbf6adfdd24cd71ab9` and add `full-test-suite` so the parity tests run? The [previous run](https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Megatron-Bridge/actions/runs/37363560237) was canceled at runner routing before any steps; downstream tests were skipped.

Pre-commit and ShellCheck pass. GPU parity has not run yet, so this stays a draft.

